  "description": "It performs a gene ontology enrichment analysis based on the ontology enrichment software FUNC. GO-annotations are obtained from OrganismDb or OrgDb packages; the GO-graph is included in the package and updated regularly. GOfuncR provides the standard candidate vs. background enrichment analysis using the hypergeometric test, as well as three additional tests.",
